# SimpleLine

`SimpleLine` is the default `lineComponent` of the stencils: the border drawn along each edge of the stencil. Dragging a line moves that edge, which resizes the stencil in one direction. [`BoundingBox`](/docs/components/BoundingBox) renders one per enabled line and passes it the props below.

```
BoundingBox
└─ SimpleLine
   └─ LineWrapper (hit area) = DraggableElement
      └─ div.advanced-cropper-line-wrapper__content
         └─ div.advanced-cropper-simple-line
```

## Usage

Restyle the lines with the stencil's `lineClassNames` and `lineWrapperClassNames`, or with a [theme](/docs/guides/themes). See [Customize Appearance](/docs/guides/customize-appearance#lines). To hide some of them, use the stencil's `lines` prop.

```svelte
<Cropper
	{src}
	stencilProps={{
		lines: { north: true, south: true },
		lineClassNames: { default: 'my-line', hover: 'my-line--hover' }
	}}
/>
```

A custom `lineComponent` receives the props below and must forward drags to `onMove` and `onMoveEnd`. `LineWrapper`, the hit area `SimpleLine` uses, is exported by this package (react-advanced-cropper keeps it internal), so you can build on it the same way as on `HandlerWrapper` in the [`SimpleHandler` example](/docs/components/SimpleHandler#usage):

```svelte
<LineWrapper
	class={wrapperClassName}
	{position}
	{disabled}
	onDrag={onMove}
	onDragEnd={onMoveEnd}
>
	<div class="my-line"></div>
</LineWrapper>
```

## Props

These are the props `BoundingBox` passes to every line component (the exported `LineComponentProps` type).

| Prop               | Type                                                                        | Description                                                                                         |
| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `position`         | `'north'` \| `'south'` \| `'east'` \| `'west'`                               | The edge the line belongs to.                                                                       |
| `disabled`         | `boolean`                                                                   | `true` when the stencil can't be resized.                                                           |
| `onMove`           | <code>(directions: MoveDirections, event: MouseEvent &#124; TouchEvent) =&gt; void</code> | Call it with each drag step.                                                                        |
| `onMoveEnd`        | `() => void`                                                                | Call it when the drag ends.                                                                         |
| `defaultClassName` | `ClassValue`                                                                | Classes for the line element, from `lineClassNames` (`default`, the direction key and `disabled`).  |
| `hoverClassName`   | `ClassValue`                                                                | Classes to add while hovered, from `lineClassNames.hover`.                                          |
| `wrapperClassName` | `ClassValue`                                                                | Classes for the hit area: the `BoundingBox` line classes plus `lineWrapperClassNames`.             |

## CSS classes

`{position}` is `north`, `south`, `east` or `west`.

| Element  | Classes                                                                                                                                                 |
| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Hit area | `advanced-cropper-line-wrapper`, `advanced-cropper-line-wrapper--{position}`, `advanced-cropper-line-wrapper--disabled`, `advanced-cropper-draggable-element` |
| Hit area | `advanced-cropper-simple-line-wrapper`, `advanced-cropper-simple-line-wrapper--{position}`                                                              |
| Content  | `advanced-cropper-line-wrapper__content`, `advanced-cropper-line-wrapper__content--{position}`                                                          |
| Line     | `advanced-cropper-simple-line`, `advanced-cropper-simple-line--{position}`, and `advanced-cropper-simple-line--hover` while hovered                     |

Unlike the handler's hit area, the line's hit area gets no `--hover` modifier. The hit area is a 12 pixel strip along the edge with a resize cursor. The line's border width comes from the base styles and its color from the theme.
